    "summary": "In your Movement phase, nominate one of your TYRANIDS MONSTER units before it is selected to move. The benefit lasts for the rest of that phase and applies to a Normal move, an Advance move and a Fall Back move. The unit can cross terrain up to 4″ tall and pass through non-TITANIC models. Its path may enter enemy Engagement Range, provided the endpoint is outside that range. Taller terrain is also passable. After crossing any of it, test once with a D6 at the end of the move. A result of 1 leaves the unit Battle-shocked.",
